					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is my favourite kind of SCP &#8212; self-aware, amusing, and more or less harmless.</p> <p>I think we need a whole lot more SCPs that are basically harmless, but break reality somehow. Because, to me, the Foundation is at its absolute worst when its trying to be scary. Tho, I do love me some uncanny and creepy SCPs&#8230; but the 'sacry' ones tend to not be very interesting.</p> 
				 	]]>
